00:04:44.000 --> 00:04:46.000
We started in November

00:04:46.000 --> 00:04:48.000
2019,

00:04:48.000 --> 00:04:50.000
which was right before the pandemic

00:04:50.000 --> 00:04:52.000
hit.

00:04:52.000 --> 00:04:54.000
We were a church for a few months

00:04:54.000 --> 00:04:56.000
and then we had to go online only

00:04:56.000 --> 00:04:58.000
for a while.

00:04:58.000 --> 00:05:00.000
I like to call us the little church that could

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:02.000
because we made it through that.

00:05:02.000 --> 00:05:04.000
I feel like if we can make it through a global pandemic,

00:05:04.000 --> 00:05:06.000
we can make it through anything.

00:05:08.000 --> 00:05:10.000
The church is nothing without

00:05:10.000 --> 00:05:12.000
the people.

00:05:12.000 --> 00:05:14.000
Thank you so much to those that have joined

00:05:14.000 --> 00:05:16.000
us along the way, those who have

00:05:16.000 --> 00:05:18.000
been with us since the beginning.

00:05:20.000 --> 00:05:22.000
Those who have given of their time

00:05:22.000 --> 00:05:24.000
and their energy and their resources to be

00:05:24.000 --> 00:05:26.000
part of this community.

00:05:26.000 --> 00:05:28.000
It matters. It makes a difference.

00:05:28.000 --> 00:05:30.000
There aren't many churches like ours in this area.

00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:32.000
It's necessary.

00:05:32.000 --> 00:05:34.000
It's important. It is life-saving.

00:05:36.000 --> 00:05:38.000
Thank you so much for being a part of it.

00:05:38.000 --> 00:05:40.000
It's a big deal.

